5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about timetables slipping when external conditions change.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We should check if similar ideas failed before.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Staff capacity is the real bottleneck here.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Funding structures often hide long-term costs.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Location and opening hours decide who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you have specific examples in mind?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Just the general pattern of unexamined history.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, how do you usually spot those hidden costs?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"By looking at how the budget is shaped, not just the size.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we need to look at transport links too.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the supplier delivery windows.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I want to see the records from six years ago.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll look at the volunteer register and training.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I need to see the grant terms and endowment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the bus links in the outer wards.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,And the winter road closures north of the river.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Also the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,And the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,And the running and equipment lines last year.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,And the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
