35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The delivery windows slip if big clients book first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,No one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it’s flat budget.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Two outer wards lost their bus link; it’s an hour round trip now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, that twelve-month limit sounds risky for long-term plans.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, so we can’t rely on external staff without training?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. The skills aren’t on the roster.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, that access issue is critical for any mobile service.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, the remote catalogue peaks after we lock up at nine.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The winter closures didn’t stop the community halls’ evening timetables.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"But the outreach stops averaged forty visitors, more than midweek main branch.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The retired tradespeople run the repair clinic, but the tool certifier retired.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The vehicle running line overran by a third last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Evening rooms are full, but we close too early for remote users.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"So physical access is fragile, but community halls are resilient.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"We have proof that outreach works, but digitisation failed.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,We lack the supervision structure for new programs.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The budget shape is the problem, not the amount.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We need to consider who is left out by current hours and locations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
